{"id":"word:hebrew:H6106","type":"word","title":"עֶצֶם","subtitle":"H6106 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"a bone (as strong ); by extension, the body ; figuratively, the substance , i.e. (as pron.) selfsame","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to עֶצֶם (H6106) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-f.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 126 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"עֶצֶם (ʻetsem) means a bone (as strong ); by extension, the body ; figuratively, the substance , i.e. (as pron.) selfsame First listed occurrence: 1Chr 10 12."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"עֶצֶם","transliteration":"ʻetsem","pronunciation":"eh'tsem","strong":"H6106","lemmaId":"hebrew:H6106","partOfSpeech":"n-f","forms":["עַצְמ֣וֹת","בְּ/עֶ֖צֶם","עַצְמ֥וֹת","בְּ/עֶ֨צֶם֙","עֶ֖צֶם"],"morphs":[["HNcfpc",18],["HR/Ncfsc",16],["HNcfpc/Sp1cs",13],["HNcfpc/Sp3ms",9],["HR/Ncfpc/Sp1cs",7],["HTd/Ncfpa",6],["HNcfpa",6],["HNcfpc/Sp3mp",5],["HNcfsc/Sp1cs",5],["HNcfsc",5]]},"definitions":{"short":"a bone (as strong ); by extension, the body ; figuratively, the substance , i.e. (as pron.) selfsame","usage":"body, bone, × life, (self-) same, strength, × very.","full":"H6106. etsem I. עֶ֫צֶם 125 noun feminine Psa 35:10 (with pronoun masculine Ezek 37:5-6 , etc., compare Albr ZAW xvi (1896). 73 ) bone, substance, self ; — absolute ׳י Gen 2:23 +; עָ֑צֶם ; Prov 15:30 ; 16:24 ; construct עֶצֶם Exod 24:10 +; suffix עַצְמִי Job 19:20 +, etc.; plural עֲצָמוֺת 2Kin 23:16 +; construct עַצְמוֺת Josh 24:22 +; suffix עַצְמֹתַי Job 4:14 +, etc.; also עֲצָמִים Ezek 24:4 +, suffix עֲצָמַי Gen 2:23 +, etc.; — 1 bone: a. of living person Micah 3:2-3 ,(hyperbole), Job 10:11 ; 19:20 ; Lam 4:8 ; Psa 102:6 ; Eccl 11:5 +; figurative of close relationship מֵעֲצָמַי עֶצָם Gen 2:23 , compare 29:14 (both J), Judg 9:2 ; 2Sam 5:1 = 1Chr 11:1 ; 2Sam 19:13 ; 19:14 (all + בָּשָׂר ). b. ׳ע + בָּשָׂר = body , Job 2:5 , plural = bodily frame Jer 20:9 (simile), limbs, members , לַעֲצָמֶיהָ Judg 9:29 i.e. limb by limb (GFM); as seat of vigour Job 20:11 , etc. c. (poetry) as seat of disease and pain Job 30:17 , 30 and (especially of personified Israel) Psa 22:15 ; 31:11 ; 102:4 ; Lam 1:13 ; Hab 3:16 +. d. plural as representing entire person = one's whole being, (especially of personified Israel) Psa 6:3 (|| נֶפֶשׁ 6:4 ), 35:10 (|| נֶפֶשׁ 35:9 ), Isa 66:14 ; of individual (including physical and moral) Prov 3:8 ; 14:30 ; 15:30 ; 16:24 . e. singular = external body Lam 4:7 Ew Th and others, but dubious; Bi Bu bones (= branches) of coral ( מְּנִינִים ); Löhr עוֺרָם their skin . f. especially of dead Num 19:16 , 18 (P), Ezek 37:1 +; often (plural) = remains Amos 6:10 ; Gen 50:25 ; Exod 13:19 (twice in verse); Josh 24:32 (all E) +. 2 bone of animal Exod 12:46 ; Num 9:12 (both P); Ezek 24:4-5 , (symbolic); of (living) hippopotamus Job 40:18 . 3 singular substance, self (compare גֶּרֶם 3 ): ׳כְּע הַשָּׁמַיִם Exod 24:10 (JE), like the substance of the sky = the sky itself; ׳בְּע תֻּמּוֺ Job 21:23 i.e. full prosperity; especially הַזֶּה הַיּוֺם ׳אֶתעֿ Ezek 24:2 this selfsame day , ׳בְּע ׳וגו 24:2 ; 40:1 ; Gen 7:13 ; 17:23 , 26 ; Exod 12:17 , 41 , 51 ; Lev 23:21 , 28 , 29 , 30 ; Deut 32:48 ; Josh 5:11 (all P), ׳עַדעֿ ׳וגו Ezek 2:3 ; Lev 23:14 (P), Josh 10:27 (R). — Ezek 24:5 a read הָעֵצִים (Bö Ew and others); 24:10 strike out הָעֲצָמוֺת (Co Toy); Job 7:15 read מֵעַצְּבוֺתָ֑י (Reiske Me Bu Du and others); Psa 53:6 read perhaps מֵעֲצַת (compare || 14:6 Bae; see Hup Che and others); 69:5 read מֵעַצְמוֺתַי (for מַצְמִיתַי ᵑ0 ), ᵑ6 Ol Che Bae and others","rootNote":"from 6105 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 10 12","keyReferences":["1Chr 10 12","1Chr 11 1","1Kgs 13 2","1Kgs 13 31","1Kgs 13 31","1Sam 31 13","2Chr 34 5","2Kgs 13 21"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":126,"occurrences":[{"referen